        "text": "Introducing the Amazon Bedrock Trusted Access API, with Enterprise Frontier Safeguards and Enterprise Data Controls for Claude models | Artificial Intelligence",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-the-amazon-bedrock-trusted-access-api-with-anthropics-enterprise-frontier-safeguards-and-enterprise-data-controls/",
